Telkom's environmental initiatives include a comprehensive e-waste management program that has processed over 500 tons of electronic waste since 2020 \cite{{Telkom_EWaste2022}}. The company has also committed to using 100\% renewable energy in its operations by 2030, with 25\% of its energy needs currently met through solar and other renewable sources \cite{{Telkom_RenewableEnergy2023}}.

