BCA's ESG strategy includes a comprehensive framework for assessing environmental and social risks in its lending activities, with over 95\% of its loan portfolio now subject to ESG screening \cite{{BCA_ESGRiskManagement2023}}. The bank has also implemented a supplier diversity program that has increased procurement from women-owned businesses by 35\% since 2020 \cite{{BCA_WomenOwnedBusiness2023}}.

